	(text "D8-D10 (SPI) and the B2B connector carry the Wio-SX1262: no PCB connection.\nGPIO numbers: include/board_pins.h. 5V (USB) unused.\nBAT+ / BAT- are pads on the XIAO underside; BAT- is the pad nearest USB-C.\nAntennas: LoRa on the Wio-SX1262 U.FL (always fitted before power-up)."
