	(text "J1: cell. J2: main switch, off-board. The pyro loop takes CELL+ before the switch.\nC1 lies flat next to U1 (rides through pyro and radio peaks). Mind the polarity.\nR1/R2: ratio 2.0 = setting batt_divider (about 20 uA).\nCharging: USB-C on the XIAO with the main switch on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
