	(text "High-current loop (about 3 A for 1 s): J1 + -> J3 (ARM) -> R3 -> J4 igniter -> Q1 -> J1 -.\nNet class Pyro: wide copper, Q1 source returns straight to J1 -, not through the logic ground.\nR7 holds Q1 off while the ESP32 boots, resets or sleeps. Fit the arm link on the pad only.\nContinuity: the drain reads >= 60 % of the battery through an intact bridge (R4/R5, setting pyro_divider)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f6eac13a-77b6-5c9b-952c-cee44a0864f6")
	)
