	(text "MPU-9250: AD0 open (address 0x68), INT unused, CS high (I2C), FSYNC low.\nOne IMU axis along the rocket axis (any sign: \"Set upright\").\nBMP280 board on 3V3, never 5V (its pull-ups go to VCC).\nBarometer: vented bay, foam, away from the ejection gases."
