	(text "This schematic is the wiring master of the flight computer.\nChange it together with include/board_pins.h and docs/HARDWARE.md,\nthen run: python tools/pcb_export.py\n\nNet names: same label = connected.\nNet classes (project settings):\n  Pyro  CELL+, ARM, IGN+, IGN-   2.5 mm\n  Power BAT_SW, +3V3, GND        0.8 mm\n  Default                        0.5 mm, clearance 0.4 mm\n\nOff-board, each on a connector: cell (J1), main switch (J2),\narm link (J3), igniter (J4).\nModule pin numbers (U1-U4) are provisional until the\nfootprints are drawn from measured parts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 294.64 30.48 0)
		(effects
